Utilisation is now 94%. The earliest gate-out slots we can offer for your con=
tainers are from 6 October, and that is not guaranteed. Revised vessel arriva=
ls are 29 Sep - 2 Oct. A change of discharge port is a matter between you and=
 the shipping line, we only handle what is discharged here. If you want to di=
vert, please do it before the vessels pass the Elbe pilot station.

Best regards,
HHT Terminal Operations
Container terminal Hamburg

-----Original Message-----
