-----Original Message-----
From: HHT Terminal Operations <hht@hht-terminal.example>
Sent: Tuesday, 22 September 2026 08:45
To: Tom Hendriks
Subject: Hamburg terminal congestion - 6 containers affected

Customer advisory: yard utilisation at Hamburg is currently above 92% and sti=
ll rising. Several vessel arrivals are delayed by 3-5 days because berth and =
yard capacity are tight. Import gate-out appointments are limited and we cann=
ot guarantee same-day pick-up for containers discharged this week. We recomme=
nd you do not book truck slots until you receive a discharge confirmation fro=
m us. We will update you every Monday and Thursday.

Best regards,
HHT Terminal Operations
Container terminal Hamburg

